      en: ["Northernmost point of Lake Tanganyika", "Former Arab-Swahili trading outpost", "Located in the South Kivu Province", "Home to the significant port of Kalundu", "Strategic gateway to the Kivu highlands", "Border town adjacent to Burundi"],
